the Scenery Channel.</i>

473
00:28:13,775 --> 00:28:15,444
I'm in the future.

474
00:28:28,123 --> 00:28:30,709
I get married in
the Chapel O Love?

475
00:28:31,043 --> 00:28:33,462
MARLENE: Mom?
Mom, is that you?

476
00:28:33,545 --> 00:28:35,631
I gotta get
out of here!

477
00:28:38,383 --> 00:28:40,135
(DOOR BELL RINGING)

478
00:28:40,219 --> 00:28:41,511
Mom!

479
00:28:50,312 --> 00:28:52,731
Mom? Mom, is that you?

480
00:28:56,360 --> 00:28:57,402
