Mr. Tannen?</i>

791
00:45:58,339 --> 00:45:59,966
<i>Third time's
the charm.</i>

792
00:46:02,760 --> 00:46:07,139
No! No!

793
00:46:07,223 --> 00:46:08,474
Hey, you're coming
with us upstairs.

794
00:46:08,557 --> 00:46:09,600
Let me go.

795
00:46:09,684 --> 00:46:12,228
Look, sonny, we can
do this the easy way
or the hard way.

796
00:46:12,770 --> 00:46:14,522
MAN: <i>The easy way.</i>

797
00:46:21,195 --> 00:46:24,282
Mom? Mom, is that you?

798
00:46:24,365 --> 00:46:25,866
OLDER LORRAINE:
Just relax, Marty.

799
00:46:26,742 --> 00:46:29,787
You've been asleep
for almost two hours.

800
00:46:31,455 --> 00:46:34,709
I had a horrible nightmare.
It was terrible.

801
00:46:35,167 --> 00:46:38,379
Well, you're safe
and sound now,

802
00:46:38,462 --> 00:46:41,048
back on the good
old 27th floor.

803
00:46:42,008 --> 00:46:43,926
Twenty-seventh floor!

804
00:46:44,719 --> 00:46:45,720
