You're supposed to
be in Switzerland,
you little son of a bitch!

818
00:47:20,171 --> 00:47:21,339
My father!

819
00:47:21,422 --> 00:47:23,382
Did you get kicked out
of another boarding school?

820
00:47:23,466 --> 00:47:25,968
Damn it, Lorraine.
Do you know how much
perfectly good dough

821
00:47:26,052 --> 00:47:27,678
I've blown on this
no-good kid of yours, huh?

822
00:47:27,762 --> 00:47:28,763
On all three of them?

823
