842
00:48:26,695 --> 00:48:29,323
So go ahead. But think
about this, Lorraine!

843
00:48:29,490 --> 00:48:31,409
Who's gonna pay for
all your clothes, huh?

844
00:48:31,492 --> 00:48:33,327
And your jewelry
and your liquor?

845
