You were the one
who wanted me to
get these things.

847
00:48:40,668 --> 00:48:43,421
If you want them back,
you can have them.

848
00:48:43,504 --> 00:48:45,798
Look, Lorraine.
You walk out that door,

849
00:48:45,881 --> 00:48:48,926
