851
00:48:50,803 --> 00:48:51,762
Wouldn't I?

852
00:48:51,846 --> 00:48:53,097
First your daughter,
Linda.

853
00:48:53,180 --> 00:48:55,057
I'll cancel all
her credit cards.

854
00:48:55,141 --> 00:48:57,643
She can settle her
debts with the bank
all by herself.

855
00:48:57,726 --> 00:49:00,855
Your idiot son, Dave.
I'll get his
probation revoked.

856
00:49:00,938 --> 00:49:03,023
And as for Marty.

857
00:49:03,107 --> 00:49:05,943
Well, maybe you'd like
to have all three
of your kids behind bars,

858
00:49:06,026 --> 00:49:08,112
just like
your brother Joey.

859
00:49:08,195 --> 00:49:10,865
One big, happy,
jailbird family.

860
00:49:13,617 --> 00:49:17,204
All right, Biff.
You win. I'll stay.

861
00:49:20,875 --> 00:49:24,795
As for you, I'll be
back up here in an hour,
so you better not be.

862
00:49:36,098 --> 00:49:38,684
He was right,
and I was wrong.

863
00:49:41,061 --> 00:49:42,771
Mom!

864
00:49:42,855 --> 00:49:43,939
Mom,
what are you saying?

865
00:49:44,023 --> 00:49:45,733
You're actually
defending him.

866
00:49:45,816 --> 00:49:48,277
I had it coming.
He's my husband,

867
00:49:48,360 --> 00:49:50,279
and he takes care
of all of us,

868
00:49:50,905 --> 00:49:52,615
