our respect.

869
00:49:52,698 --> 00:49:53,908
(YELLING) Respect?

870
00:49:54,658 --> 00:49:58,412
Your husband!
How could he
be your husband?

871
00:49:58,954 --> 00:50:00,998
How could you
leave Dad for him?

872
00:50:01,081 --> 00:50:02,333
Leave Dad?

873
00:50:02,416 --> 00:50:04,460
Marty, are you
feeling all right?

874
00:50:04,543 --> 00:50:07,004
No. No, I'm not
feeling all right!

875
00:50:07,087 --> 00:50:09,632
I don't understand
one damn thing that's
going on around here,

876
00:50:09,715 --> 00:50:12,593
