straight answer.

877
00:50:12,843 --> 00:50:15,721
Oh, they must have
hit you over the head
hard this time.

878
00:50:15,804 --> 00:50:18,891
Mom, I just want
to know one thing.

879
00:50:18,974 --> 00:50:21,977
Where's my father?
Where's George McFly?

880
00:50:23,437 --> 00:50:27,024
Marty, George,
your father

881
00:50:27,107 --> 00:50:30,236
is in the same place
he's been for
the past 12 years.

882
00:50:32,613 --> 00:50:34,573
Oak Park Cemetery.

883
00:50:34,657 --> 00:50:36,116
(THUNDER RUMBLING)

884
00:51:00,307 --> 00:51:01,642
No.

885
00:51:04,228 --> 00:51:06,981
No! This can't
be happening!

886
00:51:08,065 --> 00:51:10,317
"March 15, 1973."

887
00:51:10,401 --> 00:51:13,571
No! Please, God, no!

888
00:51:15,030 --> 00:51:17,700
No, please, God.
Please, God, no.

889
00:51:17,783 --> 00:51:19,034
This can't be happening.

890
00:51:19,702 --> 00:51:21,120
This can't be happening.

891
00:51:22,830 --> 00:51:24,331
This can't be...

892
00:51:24,415 --> 00:51:26,875
I'm afraid it is
happening, Marty.
All of it.

893
00:51:27,334 --> 00:51:28,460
Doc!

894
00:51:28,544 --> 00:51:29,878
When I learned
about your father,

895
00:51:29,962 --> 00:51:31,422
I figured
you'd come here.

896
00:51:31,505 --> 00:51:33,007
