897
00:51:33,966 --> 00:51:36,635
Then you know
what happened to him?

898
00:51:38,137 --> 00:51:43,976
Do you know
what happened
March 15, 1973?

899
00:51:45,894 --> 00:51:47,563
Yes, Marty. I know.

900
00:51:48,522 --> 00:51:49,607
DOC: I went
to the public library

901
00:51:49,690 --> 00:51:51,609
to try to make sense
out of all the madness.

902
00:51:51,692 --> 00:51:53,152
The place was
boarded up, shut down,

903
00:51:53,235 --> 00:51:55,154
