982
00:56:18,250 --> 00:56:20,586
Yeah. Money, right?
Well, forget it.

983
00:56:20,669 --> 00:56:22,546
No. Not money.

984
00:56:24,464 --> 00:56:27,926
<i>Gray's Sports Almanac.</i>

985
00:56:31,346 --> 00:56:33,307
You heard him, girls.

986
00:56:33,807 --> 00:56:35,267
Party's over.

987
00:56:36,476 --> 00:56:39,980
Start talking, kid.
What else you know
