991
00:56:50,657 --> 00:56:52,993
All right.
Take a seat.

992
00:56:56,997 --> 00:56:58,332
Sit down!

993
00:57:02,502 --> 00:57:05,297
November 12, 1955.
That was when.

994
00:57:05,380 --> 00:57:08,550
November 12, 1955.
That was the date
I went back...

995
00:57:09,843 --> 00:57:13,889
That was the date of
the famous Hill Valley
lightning storm.

996
00:57:15,057 --> 00:57:17,726
You know your history.
Very good.

997
00:57:18,685 --> 00:57:20,437
I'll never forget
that Saturday.

998
00:57:20,520 --> 00:57:22,230
I'd just picked
my car up from the shop,

999
00:57:22,314 --> 00:57:25,484
'cause I'd rolled it
in a drag race
a few days earlier.

1000
00:57:25,567 --> 00:57:28,195
I thought you crashed
into a manure truck.

1001
00:57:29,571 --> 00:57:32,157
How do you know
about that?

1002
00:57:32,240 --> 00:57:34,034
My father told me
about it.

1003
00:57:34,117 --> 00:57:35,369
Your father?

1004
00:57:36,620 --> 00:57:38,538
Before he died.

1005
00:57:39,581 --> 00:57:41,083
Yeah. Right.

1006
00:57:42,292 --> 00:57:45,170
So there I was,
minding my own business.

1007
00:57:45,253 --> 00:57:48,548
This crazy old codger
with a cane shows up.

1008
00:57:48,632 --> 00:57:50,634
