1010
00:57:54,388 --> 00:57:57,224
So he says,
"How would you
like to be rich?"

1011
00:57:57,808 --> 00:57:59,685
So I said, "Sure."

1012
00:58:04,439 --> 00:58:06,483
So he lays
this book on me.

1013
00:58:06,566 --> 00:58:08,318
He says this book
will tell me the outcome

1014
00:58:08,402 --> 00:58:11,071
