till the end of the century.

1015
00:58:11,154 --> 00:58:14,616
All I have to do is
bet on the winner,
and I'll never lose.

1016
00:58:17,828 --> 00:58:19,371
So I said,
"What's the catch?"

1017
00:58:19,454 --> 00:58:22,541
He says, "No catch.
Just keep it a secret."

1018
00:58:25,502 --> 00:58:26,545
