What about
the police, Biff?

1040
01:00:25,413 --> 01:00:27,874
They're gonna
match up the bullet
with that gun.

1041
01:00:27,958 --> 01:00:30,043
Kid, I own the police.

1042
01:00:32,045 --> 01:00:34,214
Besides,
they couldn't match up

1043
01:00:34,297 --> 01:00:36,383
the bullet that
killed your old man.

1044
01:00:36,842 --> 01:00:38,218
You son of a...

1045
