That newspaper changed.

1577
01:36:23,403 --> 01:36:25,029
Doc, my father's alive!

1578
01:36:25,113 --> 01:36:27,991
<i>That means everything's
back to normal, right?</i>

1579
01:36:31,703 --> 01:36:33,371
Mission accomplished.

1580
01:36:33,997 --> 01:36:36,582
That means Jennifer's okay
and Einie's okay, right?

1581
01:36:36,666 --> 01:36:39,794
That's right, Marty.
It's the ripple effect.

1582
01:36:39,877 --> 01:36:41,921
The future is back,
so let's go home.

1583
01:36:42,005 --> 01:36:44,799
Right. Let's get our
asses back to the...

1584
01:36:51,097 --> 01:36:52,890
Doc, Doc,
are you okay?

1585
01:36:53,224 --> 01:36:56,436
That was a close one, Marty.
I almost bought the farm.

1586
01:36:59,772 --> 01:37:03,568
Well, be careful.
You don't want to get
struck by lightning.

1587
01:37:17,790 --> 01:37:18,916
Doc.

1588
01:37:27,925 --> 01:37:28,968
Doc?

1589
01:37:30,136 --> 01:37:31,846
Doc, come in, Doc.

1590
01:37:33,514 --> 01:37:35,391
