Okay, relax, Doc.
It's me. It's me!
It's Marty.

1643
01:42:02,074 --> 01:42:04,619
No, it can't be.
I just sent you
back to the future.

1644
01:42:04,702 --> 01:42:05,828
Yeah. No, I know.
You did send me

1645
01:42:05,911 --> 01:42:07,872
